{"v":[[1,"But now they that are younger than I have me in derision, whose fathers I would have disdained to have set with the dogs of my flock."],[2,"Yea, whereto might the strength of their hands profit me, in whom old age was perished?"],[3,"For want and famine they were solitary; fleeing into the wilderness in former time desolate and waste."],[4,"Who cut up mallows by the bushes, and juniper roots for their meat."],[5,"They were driven forth from among men, (they cried after them as after a thief;)"],[6,"To dwell in the clifts of the valleys, in caves of the earth, and in the rocks."],[7,"Among the bushes they brayed; under the nettles they were gathered together."],[8,"They were children of fools, yea, children of base men: they were viler than the earth."],[9,"And now am I their song, yea, I am their byword."],[10,"They abhor me, they flee far from me, and spare not to spit in my face."],[11,"Because he hath loosed my cord, and afflicted me, they have also let loose the bridle before me."],[12,"Upon my right hand rise the youth; they push away my feet, and they raise up against me the ways of their destruction."],[13,"They mar my path, they set forward my calamity, they have no helper."],[14,"They came upon me as a wide breaking in of waters: in the desolation they rolled themselves upon me."],[15,"Terrors are turned upon me: they pursue my soul as the wind: and my welfare passeth away as a cloud."],[16,"And now my soul is poured out upon me; the days of affliction have taken hold upon me."],[17,"My bones are pierced in me in the night season: and my sinews take no rest."],[18,"By the great force of my disease is my garment changed: it bindeth me about as the collar of my coat."],[19,"He hath cast me into the mire, and I am become like dust and ashes."],[20,"I cry unto thee, and thou dost not hear me: I stand up, and thou regardest me not."],[21,"Thou art become cruel to me: with thy strong hand thou opposest thyself against me."],[22,"Thou liftest me up to the wind; thou causest me to ride upon it, and dissolvest my substance."],[23,"For I know that thou wilt bring me to death, and to the house appointed for all living."],[24,"Howbeit he will not stretch out his hand to the grave, though they cry in his destruction."],[25,"Did not I weep for him that was in trouble? was not my soul grieved for the poor?"],[26,"When I looked for good, then evil came unto me: and when I waited for light, there came darkness."],[27,"My bowels boiled, and rested not: the days of affliction prevented me."],[28,"I went mourning without the sun: I stood up, and I cried in the congregation."],[29,"I am a brother to dragons, and a companion to owls."],[30,"My skin is black upon me, and my bones are burned with heat."],[31,"My harp also is turned to mourning, and my organ into the voice of them that weep."]],"w":{"1":[["ve-'atah","and now","H6258"],["sachaku","they have laughed","H7832"],["'ala-i","on me","H5921"],["tze'irim","[people] young","H6810"],["mime-ni","more than me","H4480"],["le-yamim","to days","H3117"],["'asher","whom","H834"],["ma'asti","I rejected","H3988"],["'avota-m","fathers their","H1"],["la-shit","to put","H7896"],["'im","with","H5973"],["kalvei","[the] dogs of","H3611"],["tzon-i","flock my","H6629"]],"2":[["gam","also","H1571"],["koach","[the] strength of","H3581"],["yedei-hem","hands their","H3027"],["la-mah","<to> why?","H4100"],["l-i","to <the> me",""],["'alei-mov","on them","H5921"],["'avad","it had perished","H6"],["kalach","vigor","H3624"]],"3":[["be-cheser","in poverty","H2639"],["u-ve-khafan","and in hunger","H3720"],["galmud","barren","H1565"],["ha-'orekim","the [ones who] gnaw","H6207"],["tziyah","a dry region","H6723"],["'emesh","yesterday of","H570"],["sho'ah","ruin","H7722"],["u-mesho'ah","and desolation","H4875"]],"4":[["ha-kotefim","those [who] pluck off","H6998"],["maluach","mallow","H4408"],["'alei","on","H5921"],["siach","bush[es]","H7880"],["ve-shoresh","and [the] root of","H8328"],["retamim","broom plants